# Barrels: this repo addresses most things through an index file, so a reference lands on the
# re-exported name rather than the declaration. `deus:aliasOf` links the two, and this rule carries
# every class across that link — including through a chain of barrels, since EYE runs each rule set
# to a fixpoint.
#
# It runs LAST (filename order is the dependency mechanism): the classes it propagates are the ones
# the rule files before it concluded.

@prefix deus: <https://dxos.org/vocab/deus#>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.

{ ?alias deus:aliasOf ?origin. ?origin rdf:type ?class } => { ?alias rdf:type ?class }.
  